  "_note": "Accident-severity lexicon (spec 018, ADR-0020). Decomposes condition.ts's AFTER_ACCIDENT_PLAIN: write-off/structural/integrity markers go to `severe`; «після дтп»/«после дтп» go to `disclosure` — an accident happened, severity unstated. `disclosure` NEVER yields a bucket on its own; it only records that the topic is in play. `cosmetic` and `moderate` are reached only by their own markers, and a text verdict below `unknown` survives only with VIN corroboration (the floor in accident-severity.ts). EVERY list is negation-guarded, mirroring condition.ts — a preceding не/без/після/после suppresses the match, so «не бита», «без ДТП», «не аварійна» fire nothing. Markers are matched as lowercased substrings, so prefer stems that cannot appear inside an unrelated word («утоплен» yes, «топлен» no — it hides inside «отоплення»). Curated heuristics — versioned config, not code.",

